ind":"announcement","title":"The Rules Kaidan: Night Watch Joins Steam Next Fest with a Brand-New Demo!","summary":"Hello everyone!We'd like to share our development progress with you: the game is now 60% complete, and we expect it to be fully finished within a few months!To show you the improvements we've been making, we've released a brand-new demo for Steam Next Fest. We hope you enjoy it!If you have any questions or suggestions, feel free to let us know!If you like this demo, be sure to add The Rules Kaidan: Night Watch to your wishlist!— The Rules Kaidan: Night Watch TeamNew Demo Update NotesAdded the Of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:08:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690988","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3929660-1830163047254025","game_id":"steam-3929660","kind":"announcement","title":"The Rules Kaidan: Night Watch is now available with a free demo!","summary":"Hello everyone!The free demo of our horror game Rules of Weird is officially released today! The current demo unlocks the game’s first map: The School.The full version will include more diverse maps and a greater variety of rule mechanics.If you have any suggestions for the game, or would like to share folk tales, new weird stories, or just ordinary ghost stories with us, feel free to reach out to us!Lastly, hope you all have fun!About the DemoIn this demo, you play as a night security guard who","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-15T06:42:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047254025","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3929660-1816307528969664","game_id":"steam-3929660","kind":"announce